{{!-- {{> logo}}: the logo with the app name beside it, so the name still shows when a mail app blocks images
      (the image itself is decorative: alt=""). logoSrc comes from sendTemplateEmail (cid:logo, an attachment)
      or renderPdf (a data: URL). Inline styles and a table: they work in every mail app. --}}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;">
    <tr>
        {{!-- The gap is on the side towards the name: right in left-to-right emails, left in right-to-left ones --}}
        <td style="padding:{{#if rtl}}0 0 0 12px{{else}}0 12px 0 0{{/if}};vertical-align:middle;">
            <img src="{{logoSrc}}" width="40" height="40" alt="" style="display:block;width:40px;height:40px;border:0;">
        </td>
        <td style="vertical-align:middle;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4F46E5;">
            {{appName}}
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
